    "regime_notes": "3297 daily cross-sectional observations across 15 tradable benchmark instruments. Early/middle/late IC: 0.00288092/0.06967391/-0.01132270; strong middle-regime result but late drift remains. Breadth stress gate active on 33.35% of dates. Small cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
